    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Make a Google Sheet with a tab named **Payables** and paste the header row from `sheet-headers.csv`.\n2. Open **Settings**: sheet URL and your email.\n3. Connect Gmail (trigger and any Gmail node), Google Sheets and OpenAI on the nodes with warnings.\n4. The trigger checks unread mail matching `in:inbox (invoice OR bill) -from:me` every minute. Change that search in **New email** to match your inbox.\n5. Send yourself a test from another address, check the result, then switch to **Active**.",
        "height": 260,
